usage: multi_agent_go2_check [-h] [--config-dir CONFIG_DIR]
                             [--action {inspect,plan,approach,navigate,scan}]
                             [--offline] [--map-yaml MAP_YAML]
                             [--require-ready] [--allow-motion]
                             [--goal X Y YAW] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                             [--cancel-after CANCEL_AFTER]

Independent Go2 adapter acceptance. No task topics, peer, bridge, startup or
ARM.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config-dir CONFIG_DIR
  --action {inspect,plan,approach,navigate,scan}
  --offline             configuration report only; never initialize ROS
  --map-yaml MAP_YAML   print file digests for a candidate map; does not write
                        configuration
  --require-ready       exit 1 if reported prerequisites are incomplete
  --allow-motion        required in addition to an explicit motion action
  --goal X Y YAW        measured local Go2 map pose; approach treats X/Y as
                        object position
  --timeout TIMEOUT     inspection/action deadline in seconds
  --cancel-after CANCEL_AFTER
                        explicit cancellation acceptance during navigate/scan
